# Sukoon Windows paths (do not use "This PC")

The Windows user profile was renamed. **Never** use `C:\Users\This PC\` — that folder does not exist.

## Canonical paths

| What | Path |
|------|------|
| **Workspace / repo root** | `C:\Users\Sukoon\cursr` |
| **Flutter app** | `C:\Users\Sukoon\cursr\ebroker-sukoon-app` |
| **Build copy (optional)** | `G:\develop\ebroker-sukoon-app` |
| **Flutter SDK** | `G:\develop\flutter` |
| **Android SDK** | `G:\develop\Android\Sdk` |
| **JDK (Android Studio)** | `G:\develop\Android\Android Studio\jbr` |
| **Pub cache** | `G:\develop\pub-cache` |
| **ADB** | `G:\develop\Android\Sdk\platform-tools\adb.exe` |

## Replacements when fixing old configs

- `C:\Users\This PC\cursr` → `C:\Users\Sukoon\cursr`
- `C:\Users\This PC\flutter` → `G:\develop\flutter`
- `H:\develop\` → `G:\develop\` (drive moved H → G)

## Android app IDs (unchanged)

- `applicationId`: `homes.sukoon.group`
- `namespace` / `MainActivity`: `com.ebroker.wrteam`

## Terminal / Cursor

Open folder: `C:\Users\Sukoon\cursr` or `cursr.code-workspace` — not `This PC\cursr`.
